## A5 the same registration again is quiet (changed:false, no new audit row); the idempotency key replays
```json
{
  "again": {
    "changed": false,
    "replaced": null
  },
  "replay": {
    "deduped": true,
    "changed": true
  },
  "auditRowsBefore": 1,
  "auditRowsAfter": 1
}
```

## A6 a codex bee and a claude bee spawned on their accounts: the homes' native MCP configs point at the registered URL; the stdio file gateway (foundation) is still seeded beside it
```json
{
  "codexConfigToml": [
    "[mcp_servers.apiary]",
    "url = \"http://127.0.0.1:7788/mcp\"",
    "[mcp_servers.foundation]",
    "command = \"/opt/node-v24.18.0-linux-x64/bin/node\"",
    "args = [\"foundation-fixture.mjs\", \"mcp\"]"
  ],
  "codexStamp": {
    "schema": 1,
    "files": {
      "config.toml": {
        "apiary": {
          "url": "http://127.0.0.1:7788/mcp"
        },
        "foundation": {
          "command": "/opt/node-v24.18.0-linux-x64/bin/node",
          "args": [
            "foundation-fixture.mjs",
            "mcp"
          ],
          "envVars": [
            "HIVE_BEE",
            "HIVE_BEE_ID"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "claudeMcpServers": {
    "apiary": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:7788/mcp"
    },
    "foundation": {
      "command": "/opt/node-v24.18.0-linux-x64/bin/node",
      "args": [
        "foundation-fixture.mjs",
        "mcp"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

## A7 re-registering a new URL: the populated homes converge on the next activation
```json
{
  "result": {
    "changed": true,
    "replaced": {
      "url": "http://127.0.0.1:7788/mcp",
      "tokenIssuer": "apiary-spawn-token-v1"
    },
    "url": "https://apiary.local:7443/mcp/v2"
  },
  "codexApiaryLine": "url = \"https://apiary.local:7443/mcp/v2\"",
  "claudeApiary": {
    "type": "http",
    "url": "https://apiary.local:7443/mcp/v2"
  },
  "foundationStill": true
}
```

