## B3 the same tree again: idempotency replay is deduped; a fresh call is changed:false with every home unchanged
```json
{
  "replay": {
    "deduped": true
  },
  "again": {
    "changed": false,
    "homes": [
      "codex-lx:unchanged",
      "claude-cy:unchanged"
    ]
  },
  "audits": 1
}
```

